      "tr_span": "chapters/directories.vn.qmd:189-189",
      "proposition": "Calling source() on a script is equivalent to opening that R script and clicking the \"Source\" button. The Vietnamese paragraph begins mid-sentence at \"o phia tren ben phai cua tap lenh\" (\"in the upper-right of the script\"); the whole opening clause naming the equivalence and the \"Source\" button is absent.",
      "reader_consequence": "The Vietnamese reader gets a sentence fragment that starts with a location phrase referring to nothing, never learns that source() is the same as clicking the Source button, and cannot interpret the screenshot of the Source button inserted immediately below (chunk at lines 191-193).",
