      "proposition": "The purrr example splits a data frame and saves it out as multiple CSV files. The Vietnamese bullet says only \"luu no ra duoi dang nhieu tap tin\" (\"save it out as multiple files\") and drops the file format CSV.",
      "reader_consequence": "The Vietnamese reader loses the CSV-versus-Excel contrast that the four bullets are built on, and cannot tell which of the two saving examples produces plain-text files.",
