      "proposition": "The Vietnamese says here() is used \"de hien thi ket qua duoi dang viet toc ky\" (\"to display the result in shorthand form\"); the English only says here() is used as shorthand for the R project root, and the accompanying code at line 34 shows here() supplying a path to dir_tree(), not displaying anything.",
